## Created by Bjornar Hvidsten - nenania@proton.me:
##
## Sequence based on Circle Of Self Empowerment
## (Channeled by Bashar through Darryl Anka)
##
## Monaural version - headphones not needed, but still recommended.
##
## Brainwaves:
## Epsilon 	 .5 Hz
## Delta 	 .5 - 3 Hz
## Theta 	  3 - 8 Hz
## Alpha 	  8 - 12 Hz
## Beta 	 12 - 40 Hz
## Gamma 	 40 - 100 Hz
## Lamba	100 - 200 Hz on a .5 Hz carrier wave (epsilon) creating a "circle"

-SE 

off: -

epsilon05:	200+0/6.5 200.5+0/6.5 mix/85

delta05:	  200+0/6.5 200.5+0/6.5 mix/85

theta3:		  200+0/6.5 203+0/6.5 mix/85

alpha8:		  200+0/6.5 208+0/6.5 mix/85

beta12:		  200+0/6.5 212+0/6.5 mix/85

gamma40:	  200+0/6.5 240+0/6.5 mix/85

lambda100:	200+0/3.25 300+0/3.25 200+0/3.25 200.5+0/3.25 mix/85

lambda200:	200+0/3.25 400+0/3.25 200+0/3.25 200.5+0/3.25 mix/85

0:00:00 == off ->
0:01:00 == epsilon05 ->
0:03:00 == delta05 ->
0:05:00 == theta3 ->
0:07:00 == alpha8 ->
0:09:00 == beta12 ->
0:11:00 == gamma40 ->
0:13:00 == lambda100 ->
